Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:06:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 48/48] Per-instance primvars: ObjectInstance Attribute "shape"
 "string hdpbrtinstanceprimvars" / "float hdpbrtinstanceprimvarvalues";
 instance primitives (and instanced emitters) put them in the hit's primvar
 lookup ahead of the prototype's (for hdPbrt)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
